text.text:
In AUTO mode, AutoSwitch locks the differentials (Enhanced Vehicle) when the wheels slip:
• rear at 15 % slip, then front at 30 % (adjustable thresholds);
• the slip must last 1.5 s before locking (adjustable);
• unlocked when the slip falls back to half the threshold.

A notification is shown on each lock and unlock (can be turned off). Locks are reset when the game is loaded.

Right Ctrl + C, or a click on the field icon (with "Click me" written under it), opens the list of your fields. One line per owned field:
• Field: the game's number;
• Crop and Stage;
• Sown, Fertilizer, Herbicide: date of the last pass;
• Harvest: when the crop will be ready.

The mouse wheel scrolls the list; the cross at the top closes the window.

Right Ctrl + R opens the register, in three tabs:
• Weighings: each pass on a weighbridge (sent by AutoDrive Addon), with the place and who weighed (AutoDrive or the player);
• Sales: each sale with the product, quantity, amount and selling point. Unloading a trailer arrives in small pieces: they are grouped into a single line;
• Totals: per month and per product.

Totals are shown at the bottom of each tab.

The lights of all vehicles, yours included, reach further and shine brighter, with one setting per light type (reach and brightness together, from x1.1 to x2.5):
• headlights: x2;
• front and rear work lights: x2;
• beacon lights, signal lights (turn signals, brake, reverse) and other lights: x1.1.

"Enhanced headlights: No" restores the base game lights, with no computing at all.
